Modifications by the Defold Foundation, also under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  - ported to ESM and the node24 runtime (upstream still declares node20)
  - the asset manifest is imported and inlined into the bundle by ncc rather than
    read from disk at runtime, because `__dirname` does not exist in ESM
  - rebuilt with @vercel/ncc instead of parcel; yarn replaced by npm with a
    committed package-lock.json
  - dependencies updated to current majors, which are ESM-only
  - the lodash chain in the asset generator replaced with a plain loop
  - upstream's network-dependent test CLI replaced with offline unit tests
  - the LLVM asset manifest regenerated past the fork point (adds LLVM 22 and 23)
